eue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信内测小微AI社交功能 支持原生AI助手跨账号代理沟通</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">中国大模型调用量连续19周领跑全球，腾讯混元Hy4 preview周增379%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic旗下Claude模型11天完成费马大定理端到端形式化证明</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云千问办公发布多人工作台，支持一句话生成百人协作业务网页</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f52cd0fb407013e0bd6d0f4b1b8ba9fb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月7日，阿里云千问办公推出业内首个“多人工作台”，用户通过自然语言描述需求，即可自动生成并发布支持百人同时在线协作的业务网页。该功能具备角色权限配置、云端数据库、管理后台及在线发布四项核心能力，支持管理员与成员分权操作，并能统一沉淀任务状态与工作进展。与市面上的个人AI工具不同，该工作台面向活动组织、家校协同及企业协作等场景，系统可根据自然语言指令自动拆解业务流程，并支持后续动态修改。相比传统采购ERP、OA或垂直SaaS需数月开发周期的模式，该功能通过AI直接生成业务应用，显著降低了流程数字化门槛，标志着AI工具正从个人助手向企业级协作场景加速演进。目前，用户可通过千问办公首页功能入口直接体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">李飞飞团队发布多模态世界模型Atlas，以新视角预测重构三维生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/56a316bb9be45a2ce59bd7dff740e373.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">李飞飞及其团队World Labs正式推出多模态世界模型Atlas，该模型将“新视角预测”确立为核心原语，旨在实现生成与重建的深度融合。与预测下一token或下一帧的传统逻辑不同，Atlas支持输入多视角图像或文本，精准输出时空任意位置画面，原生处理文字、图像、视频、3D及相机位姿等多模态数据。该模型基于Marble迭代升级，通过极低数据成本即可实现三维空间还原，仅需少量照片即可生成高质量3D场景，解决了传统重建依赖大量数据及盲区补全的痛点。Atlas具备高度可扩展的空间上下文窗口，目前已在创意设计、建筑施工及机器人仿真训练等领域展现出应用潜力。研发团队表示，未来将重点推进动态效果、内容编辑及人机交互能力，致力于构建支持用户与3D虚拟世界直观交互的完整系统，该技术被视为通往AGI的核心原语之一。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信内测小微AI社交功能 支持原生AI助手跨账号代理沟通</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/92d8162c44f46d33912b0beb9b3e3928.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信正在小范围内测“小微AI社交”功能，标志着其原生智能助手在Agent社交协同领域取得进展。用户向自身账号的“小微”下达指令后，该AI可跨账号寻找目标好友的“小微”展开独立对话。在获得对方授权确认后，两个智能体先行完成需求对接与信息交换，涉及关键决策时系统会提醒用户人工确认，形成“AI先行沟通、用户最终拍板”的闭环。作为集成于微信主界面左上角入口的原生AI助手，“小微”此前已具备调起小程序、搜索生成内容及聊天辅助等能力。此次更新推动“小微”从工具型单机助手向多智能体协同网络演进，预示着人际交互正加速向“Agent对齐”与“智能体代理社交”阶段转型。腾讯官方目前对该内测消息暂无正面回应。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国大模型调用量连续19周领跑全球，腾讯混元Hy4 preview周增379%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d98a2a3db9c3d3010c195a7cf5661e49.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">根据OpenRouter数据，8月31日至9月6日全球AI大模型总调用量达115万亿Token，中国模型周调用量达56.72万亿Token，连续19周位居全球首位。腾讯混元Hy4 preview以14.7万亿Token的周调用量登顶全球榜首，环比增长379%。该模型于8月28日开源，具备770B总参数、49B激活参数及1M上下文长度，重点优化Agent与Coding场景。9月1日推出的轻量版将权重压缩至约214GB，降低了本地部署门槛。榜单前五名中，中国模型占据四席，包括智谱GLM-5.3 Flash及DeepSeek-V4系列。此外，MiniMax M3重回榜单第六，并成为沙特HUMAIN公司研发阿拉伯语大模型的基础底座，标志着中国模型从API出海转向技术底座输出。同期美国模型调用量环比下滑3.1%，市场格局</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic旗下Claude模型11天完成费马大定理端到端形式化证明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/17ffdfc96bae1502e7b03d76fcd0dfa8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日宣布，其内部研究模型在11天内成功完成了费马大定理（FLT）的端到端、计算机检查形式化证明。该工作旨在将安德鲁·怀尔斯于1995年的原始证明转换为Lean证明助手可验证的形式。Claude通过多智能体协作，在Prove2Me平台上生成了约1300万行Lean代码，证明了约3.03万个定理，最终消耗约60亿输出Token。该项目由研究员Tianyi Peng发起，证明过程遵循Darmon、Diamond和Taylor的简化版本，并仅使用Lean的3条标准公理。此次成果证明了AI在大规模数学证明形式化中的潜力，有望大幅降低未来数学研究中验证新证明的人工成本。目前，该完整Lean证明已在GitHub公开，数学家Kevin Buzzard审阅后认为，这标志着AI辅助形式化大型数学成果取得重要进展。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
